Subject: [PATCH v5 4/5] scsi: scsi_transport_sas: Cap shost max_sectors according to DMA optimal limit
Date:   Thu, 30 Jun 2022 20:08:11 +0800
Message-ID: <1656590892-42307-5-git-send-email-john.garry@huawei.com>
